cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the frozen evidence it carries, please cite the
  article under preferred-citation. A direct software citation may use the
  metadata below.
title: >-
  Direct-H8 Transport: code and frozen evidence for multi-step supervision in
  recurrent building world models
abstract: >-
  Experimental code, the frozen 72-trajectory input corpus, and sealed result
  tables for an open-loop comparison of recurrent building prediction models
  under synthetic sensor faults and action-dwell shift, together with a bounded
  descriptive downstream supervisory evaluation in three public BOPTEST
  simulator cases.
